<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">1PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">1PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1PE - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">1PE - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Icɛr yiŋɛ ire bǝn Nga Biturus, ne na ndum kɛ Yesɔ Kristi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Abaŋ ndi Arik ne hria ba, abaŋ ndi ayi agɛn ne aklu aŋar te yi ne Fantas, bǝn Galantiya, bǝn Kafadɔsiya, bǝn Asiya, bǝn Bitiniya, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />izhin ndi Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr ne hria zhin ne izhi maa, te ŋla ta ne Izhu tsetser ne ŋla ba ne azhizhi Yesɔ, te bɛ zǝ iki bla Yesɔ kristi ne shur azhizhi amaa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Ta zhɔk bǝn sɔŋ kɛ sik bǝ yi ne atu min tetɛk<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igbar Arik asak ne tsin kɛ shur ayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Tabǝ gbar Arik asak waŋ ndi wa ayi Tetɛɛ mɔr ayɔu Yesɔ kristi! Nǝ lɔ susun maa ne duŋ ana ŋli ta te ta bǝ tsǝntsǝn kɛ shur ayi ne lu Yesɔ ne bɛ, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />te ta bǝ ta gadu kɛ yaŋ cɔkla, kɛ yaŋ dɔ bǝn yaŋ klɛ ndi ne nyak ta ne shu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Taba abaŋ ndi Arik ne ku ta ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa ne tanyɛme ne asusun amɔr te gar nkpaŋ kɛ ta ta zhɔk ne klɛ tu. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Nǝ yiŋɛ izhin bǝ nyɛr ŋgɔŋ, neme izhin te yik iyah watsɔb azizaŋa ndi atei tsar zhin neyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Iyiŋɛ tei na te bɛ yik itanyɛme ne susun min iyiŋ ndi ne naŋ ire kɛ zineriya, ikeŋ ndi cɔkla, ndi agɔŋ kɛ ne lu, te duŋ itanyɛme yi susun min bǝ duŋ anǝk ngɔŋ te na gbar zhin asak ndi Yesɔ te nyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Neme ndi bane zǝn yigu ba, izhin ne nye ru, ama ba zhin ne zen yigu ba, izhin ne tanyɛme ben abɔu tena nye ru ngɔŋ ndi nkanlɛ iye ne batei blai ba, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />izhin ne ta idǝk min kɛ tanyɛme ben Yesɔ ne asusun, ita zhɔk yi asusun min.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Ne atu yi ta zhɔk, abɛ bla shar yi Arik, ne lɛ ne atu ayi iki didik ndi sɔŋ nyɛ, ne zǝb lɛ kɛ Arik ikɛ ta zhɔk kǝŋe ne hria ayi, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />te wɔb te aba bǝ zhi mkpaŋ ben nkuŋkɔŋ yiŋ ndi Izhu tsetser yi Yesɔ kristi ndi yi ben abɛba ndi ne tsar te bla mkpaŋ kǝŋe ndi Kristi atei yik iyah ben ŋgɔŋ keŋ ndi itei zǝ. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Arik ne men abla abɛ bla shar maa tedi ba ana atu men gen ba ama ana izhineba ba, te lǝlɛ kiki yiŋ ndi neka blaa zhin neyi nenu abaŋ ndi ne du zhin lɛ didik ire ben Izhu tsetser iyi rɛ shu. waŋa ayi kiki yiŋ ndi abɛ shar ayou Arik ne zen wɔb te aba bɛ yige.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isɔŋ kɛ tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Neme, izhin bǝ na asusun amin nyak ayi na ndum; izhin bǝ vuŋ kpa; izhin bǝ shur ayi ne ikiki yiŋ ndi atei nek zhin neyi ndi Yesɔ kristi te nyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ndi amumun abɛ nek atu, kǝr zhin bǝ zǝ kiki mimin iyi na min kukub ndi izhin ne yaŋ zhi Arik ba. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ama yi tsetser ne kɔte ni ndi izhin nai ndi Arik ine zhɔ zhin ayi tsetser, neme izhin bǝ yi tsetser ne kɔte ni ndi izhin nai; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />fe ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di: &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ yi tsetser te Nga Myi tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ndi izhin zhɔ Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi izhin te ben Arik, atei ŋas ndum kɛ kɔte ŋɔwa, yaŋ nyɛr tu, izhin bǝ sɔŋ ndi acɛn ne gɔŋ mimi ne te sǝsǝk. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Izhin ne zhi te bane atazhin azhɔk ne kiki yi na min kukub yi yaŋ rɛ ndi ibaŋ rɛ ben atsintsim amin ba. Bǝn kiki iyi yaŋ cɔkla ndi zineriya bǝn azurfa ba, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ama ayi azhizhi ayou Yesɔ ane rɛ ŋgɔŋ, nklu ndi ayi keke. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Waŋ ndi ne hriau teshe na gɔŋmimi, ayi wa ne gliu aru zhine ne klɛ tu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ne atu amaa izhin ne zhi Arik, waŋ ndi ne lɛgu ne bɛ te nǝgu ŋgɔŋ, neme itanyɛme min ben shur ayi min bǝ klik ne zǝ Arik.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Neme ndi izhin ne duŋ asusun amin ayi tsetser ne zǝ iki didik ne tanyɛme ben zumin, te na tanyɛ ben anuŋ, ne asusun amin. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Tǝ ne akama ŋli zhin, ba ne bǝbǝ yi cɔkla ba, ne lɛ kɛ Arik tsitsir kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Tǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Bɔbɔk aneshir ayi ndi agǝga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">Ire men iyi ndi gbar kuŋkun iyi zizik;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Agǝga aklu fe dɔ kuŋkun izu,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Ama ilɛ ikɛ men kɛ Arik ba yi ne klɛ tu ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Waŋa ayi lɛ keŋ ndi ne du zhin ne kɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Neme, izhin bǝ duŋ cɔk sak ner la ne asusun amin, bǝn itimu, bǝn kam gli, ben te zɔr. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Izhin bǝyi ndi asen vǝvǝn ne tashi ŋli, iwaŋ ndi awɔb amayak, izhin bǝ wɔb lɛ kɛ Arik ndi itei duŋ zhin flu ne ta zhɔk min, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />fe ndi izhin ne wɔ men kɛ didik kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ayi ndi tanda yi me ben aner abɛ hria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Izhin bǝ nyɛ ben Ŋgɔŋ, mkpaŋ tsetser, iyiŋ ndi aneshir ne kyagǝ, ama Arik ne hriau te nǝgu ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Izhineba min yi, izhin yi ndi mkpaŋ tsitsir, ndi atei me ikɔb kɛ izhu tsetser te izhin bǝ yi abɛ na ndum ne kɔb kɛ Arik, te izhin bǝ nek atu amin ndi ibaŋ yiŋ ndi Arik ne tei ne atu yi Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Te ne cɛr ne ilɛ kɛ Arik te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin, mne nyak mkpaŋ yi me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Nǝ Siyona, mne hria mkpaŋ didik iyi nju ki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Iwaŋ ndi atei tanyɛme ben Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Ba tei te ishisha ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Azizaŋa izhineba ndi izhin ne tanyɛme, mkpaŋ yiŋɛ iyi didik. ama abaŋ ndi ba ne tanyɛme neyi ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi abɛ me ne kyak gǝ bɔbɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">Ai yi iyi mkpaŋ didik yi me,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Fe ilɛ kɛ Arik ne na bla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi iduŋ aneshir atar aza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">Bǝn mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi iduŋ aneshir azhaku.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ne kyak ilɛmɛ te tar aza waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne ka nai aŋyak ba.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ama izhineba ba yi aneshir abɛ hria, aneshir abɛ na Itum ŋgɔŋ ndum, ntun iyi tsetser, aneshir abɛ Arik, te izhin bǝ gbar Arik asak iwaŋ ndi ne zhɔ zhin arumɔ ne bu te gli zhin anyɛ amkpa agɔŋ adidik ane laŋ amaa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Nǝ kukub ba zhin ne yi aner azhin ba, ama azizaŋa izhin yi aneshir abɛ Arik; kukub ba zhin ne yik lɔ susun ba, ama izhin ne yik kɛ azizaŋa.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Izhineba ba amunya, mben zhin, te izhin yi acɛn ne gɔŋmimi kǝŋe, izhin bǝ te shaan ne iki yi tik ayi yi gɔŋmimi, te itsǝk mgbu ne kiki iye asusun amin. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Izhin bǝ tsǝntsen didik ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi ba ne zhi Arik ba, ate yi ndi atei di izhin na iki mimin, abɛ yik iki yi na min didik te bɛ nek Arik ŋgɔŋ maa ne bɛr yiŋ ndi Arik ate nyɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inǝk atu bǝn abɛ gli aneshir bǝn atukɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ne tu yi Arik zhin bǝ nek kɔte ŋɔwa ndi agli aneshir atu amin ne sak kɛ Arik: kɔ ben Itum waŋ ndi ayi ŋgɔŋ, te wa ayi ŋgɔŋ bɔbɔk, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />izhin bǝ na nek atu amin ben igomneti, aba Arik ne shar ba abɛ nek aneshir abɛ lalɛ iyah, abɛ na gbar abɛ na iki didik asak. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Tǝ ayi na Arik nena iki didik min itei ku anu aneshir abɛ ye bliblik. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Izhin bǝ tsin ndi abɛ ta zhɔk, ama kǝr zhin bǝ ku goŋ ne ta zhɔk min te na zumimin ba; ama izhin bǝ tsin ndi agɛn abɛ Arik. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Izhin bǝ nek kɔte ŋɔwa atu amin: Izhin bǝ nyɛr amunya, klu zhin sisik Arik, nek zhin itum ŋgɔŋ maa.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝk lɛ yi yik iyah yi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Izhineba ba agɛn, izhin bǝ nek atukɔ amin atu min ne kɔte anii, ba abɛ na iki didik ankyak ba, ama ben abaŋ ndi ayi ŋaŋar ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Neme ire te ineshir bɛ yik iyah ne atu yi Arik, te na vuŋ asusun Gli ne kɔte nii te ne zhi Arik. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ama aye nii iki ŋur asa min ate tsik zhin ne na iki mimin te izhin te vuŋ susun neyii? Ama ate yi ndi izhin yik iyah ne na iki didik te vuŋ susun, waŋa ai yi ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne ta nyɛmɛ te nek anu adidik. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Neme ne zhɔ zhin, te Kristi ne yik iyah ne atu amin, ne duŋ zhin ankɔŋ ane zǝ, izhin bǝ zǝ ankɔŋ ane yik iyah maa.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ bane la lɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">Ba nena timu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ne yenu, ba ne di kinuŋ ba, ne sagu iyah ba ne na di ikinuŋ ba. Ne me ne nek tu maa ben ine te ambuk tetɛɛ didik. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Kristi wa ne tu maa ne baŋ zumimin mɔr ne ku te kpaŋu ne kpok kuŋkun kɛ gen, te ta bǝ ku ne zumimin te yi atsitsir ne nyɛr ye Arik; Ne amkpaa amaa ne duŋ zhin rɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Izhin ne yi ndi awanta abaŋ ndi ne dɔ, ama azizaŋa izhin ne kam nyak ben ne kyu zhin te aŋub zhin.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isɔŋ kɛ alulum bǝn amba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Neme amba, izhin bǝ nek alulum amin atu amin, te yi ndi anuŋ ne miŋ min ba zi lɛ kɛ Arik ba, iki yi na amba men ben lǝlɛ men itei duŋ alulum anuŋ azǝ Arik, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ate yik tsetser ben iki didik yi na min. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Irɛ min kɛ amba kǝr bǝ yi ne abɛm ankyak ba, iluk tu ben iki kɔr ne tɔŋ yi te anyaŋ ben nkluŋklu yi rɛ ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Neme, izhin bǝ duŋ rɛ min bǝ rɛ miŋ asusun amin, ire kɛ yaŋ cɔkla kɛ zi tu zhɔk ben vuŋ kpa, waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi Arik anyɛri. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Waŋa ayi ir keŋ ndi amba tsetser abɛ kukub abɛ zǝ Arik ne duŋ, ne nek alulum amen atu men, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />ndi Saratu, ne nek ilu maa Ibrai tu maa te zhɔu te ŋgɔŋ amaa. Izhin yi aŋɔ amaa ndi izhin te na iki didik, izhin bǝ duŋ tǝ sisik ba.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Alulum, izhineba ba min yi, izhin bǝ sɔŋsɔŋ didik ben amba min, izhin bǝ gli amba min ne ankɔŋ adidik ndi abɛ yaŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ abɛ li gadu bǝ abɛ zhin ne iki didik yi lieru, te kǝr ikinuŋ bǝ yar ben min yir aŋɔk Arik ba.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyik iyah ne na iki didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ne klɛtu, bɔbɔk min, izhin bǝ sɔŋsɔŋ kɛ sik asusun ne akpa amin; izhin bǝ lɔ susun kɛ akpa, abɛ tanyɛme ne kpa, te nyɛr akpa ne zǝ tu zhɔk. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Waŋ ndi te na zhin iki mimin kǝr zhin bǝ nau mayi ba, ate yen zhin kǝr zhin bǝ yen yaa maa ba, ne me izhin bǝ nek ba anu adidik, te iyeme Arik ne zhɔ zhin te zhin bǝ ta anu adidik. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi te wɔb te wa abɛ wɔ men kɛ sɔŋ maa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Te na yik iber didik</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Abɛ vuŋ anu maa gli ne ki mimin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Te na duŋ kam aŋa.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Abɛ duŋ na iki mimin te na iki didik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">Te na wɔb sɔŋ keke.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Tǝ ayi Arik ayi bǝn abɛ yi tsetser</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Ana bu atɔŋ amaa te wɔ ben men,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Ama Arik akyak abɛ na iki mimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Iŋɔwa atei na zhin iki mimin ndi zhin te nek atu ne na iki didik? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ama ate yi ndi izhin tei yik iyah ne na iki didik, izhin tei ta anu adidik. &lt;&lt;Kǝr izhin bǝ te sisik iki yiŋ ndi ate sisik maa ba; izhin bǝ duŋ te sisik ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Neme ne asusun amin izhin bǝ baŋ Kristi ayi Arik. Izhin bǝ na sɔŋ te bla kɔte ŋɔwa ndi arib zhin lɛ kɛ shur ayi amin ndi izhin yime ne kǝ. Ama izhin bǝ na amɛ ne zi tu zhɔk bǝn nek ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Izhin bǝ duŋ idur min bǝ yi tsetser, te abaŋ ndi ayen zhin ne na iki didik ne ankɔŋ ayou Kristi shisha tei vuŋ ba ne wɔb cɔk asak amin la. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Itei rɛ, ate yi ndi ayi na Arik izhin bǝ yik ya ne na didik naŋ na iki mimin. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Te Kristi ne ku ne la lɛ mɔr mkpaŋ zhiin bɔbɔk, abɛ yi tsetser ben abɛ yaŋ yi tsetser, te bǝ gli ta aglii Arik ge. Ne ŋunu ne kpa, ama atei yi tsitsir ne Izhu, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ne izhu mɔ ne gar te kɔte du izhu abɛ ku ndi ayi ne jaru lɛ kɛ Arik <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />abaŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik kukub ndi Arik ne vuŋ susun te ŋub ba ne bɛr yi Nuhu ndi ne zen na igu. Ne min gumɔ aneshir watsɔb, aneshir atender ankyak, ne li aru ne amashir, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />amashir awaŋa ayi ndi isu aneshir yiŋ ndi ita zhin shur, ba gli irik iglirumɔ ne kpa min ba ama ne ben Arik ne susun didik. Ne lu Yesɔ Kristi ne bɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />iwaŋ ndi ne kɔmɔ ne gbarshu te yi ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik ben abɛ shar amaa, mgbyamgbyaŋ ben ŋgɔŋ iyi ne ŋɔk maa.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isɔŋ kɛ ŋub nyɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Neme, Yesɔ ne yik iyah ne kpa maa, izhineba min yi izhin bǝ tanyɛme te yik iyah ndi maa, waŋ ndi ate yik iyah ne kpa ne duŋ na zumimin. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Nǝ na me, ba tei na zumimin ne sɔŋ maa kɛ gɔŋmimi ba, ama atei na iki yiŋ ndi Arik anyɛri. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Tǝ ne kukub izhin ne klɛ mkpaŋ min nena iki yiŋ ndi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik anai, awɔb men kɛ gɔŋmimi, ize kiki yi tik ayi, iso ki rǝrǝ, ili igyaŋ, ize amba ben alulum, ben zi arik ne yaŋ vli. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ayi iki yayas ben aba ir keŋ ndi ba zhin bine tu bǝn aba azizaŋa ba, izhin ne tun atu amin ne na ikiki yiŋɛ, te yen zhin. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ama Arik wa atei aneshir a bla ikiki yiŋ ndi ne nai ne ti kɛ waŋ ndi wa atei te abɛ ku ben abɛ vli ambuk. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi ne du lɛ didik kɛ Arik ben abaŋ ndi neka ku, ndi atei te ba ambuk ne mkpaŋ kɛ aneshir, te bɛ tsin ne izhu ndi Arik ne tanyɛme maa.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ na ndum didik ne nek Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Iklɛ tu yi kɔte ni ne te gbahir. Neme izhin bǝ zhɔk kpa, te vuŋ kpa, te izhin bǝ zhi ben Arik. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Neme bɔbɔk, izhin bǝ tanyɛme ne akpa min ŋgon, te tanyɛme ne kpa iku lalɛ yir tetɛk. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Izhin bǝ ta akpa ne akɔb amin ne yaŋ lɛ mumur. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ na ndum ne zhi yiŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu te duŋ anuŋ abɛ flu ne lɛ kɛ Arik, ine na ndum didik ne ankɔŋ yi Arik ne nkunkɔŋ tetɛk. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Inuŋ ate lɛ, abɛ zhi te wa alɛ ilɛ kɛ Arik. Iwaŋ ndi atei na ndum, abɛ na kɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu ne kǝ, atei gbar Arik asak ne kɔte nii ne sak kɛ Yesɔ Kristi. Ŋgon ben mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝ yi ben Arik gar klɛ tu. Bǝyi amɛ.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyik iyah ne atu ayi zǝ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Izhin akpa amuŋ, kǝr zhin bǝ vuŋ anu ne iyah ŋgon ndi izhin yigǝ ba, ndi ayi kinuŋ yayas ivuŋ zhin ba. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ama izhin bǝ nyɛr te zhin yik iyah ir kɛ Kristi, te izhin tei nyɛr ngɔŋ ndi ŋgɔŋ ate nyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ate yen zhin ne atu yi sak kɛ Kristi, anu adidik kɛ Arik ayi amin, te Izhu yi ŋgon Arik iyi ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Izhin te yik iyah, kǝr iyik iyah min ibǝ yi ne atu yi ŋun neshir kɔ izhib kɔ na iki nuŋ mimin, kɔ ne zǝb aza anuŋ ba. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ama izhin te yik iyah ne atu yi zǝ Kristi, kǝr zhin bǝ te shisha ba, ama abɛ nyɛr Arik asak te wa ayi ne sak kǝŋe. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Tǝ mkpaŋ neka te kɛ te ambuk ndi itei vuŋ rɛ ben abɛ zǝ Arik; ate yi ndi atei kuti ate te abɛ zǝ Arik ŋas, iklɛtu abɛ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik itei yi kikin? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ndi lɛ kɛ Arik di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi abɛ zǝ Arik atei lieru ne miŋ kɛ iyah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">Itei yi kikin ben abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik ben abɛ na zumimin?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Neme, abaŋ ndi ayik iyah ne atu ayi Arik abɛ nek waŋ ndi iwa nena ta, te na ikiki didik.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Mcɛr anuŋkub ben Amunanzak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Mcɛr anuŋkub ne miŋ mine, Mben zhin akpa amuŋ anuŋkub, ne yik iyah iyi Kristi ben iwaŋ ndi atei nek gab ŋgɔŋ keŋ ndi iyi bǝn kristi ne shu. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Izhin bǝ yi ndi abɛ kyu aneshir abaŋ ndi ne nek zhin ŋub bama, na zhin ndi abɛ blɛ amkpa, kǝr bǝ yi ndi asak zhin ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, ama ibǝ yi itanyɛme ne asusun amin, ndi Arik ata nyɛmɛ ne na mine; ba ne su ayi ne wɔb azɔb ba, ama ne tanyɛme min; <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />kǝr zhin bǝ yi ihru ne atu aye abaŋ ndi ne nek zhin ŋub bama ba, neme ubǝ duŋ ba baŋ nkɔŋ mi. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Fena ate yi ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ne ŋub tama ate muŋ aru, izhin tei ta idǝk min ŋgɔŋ ndi ba tei ce ba.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Izhin amunanzak ben aŋɔ, ina yeme izhin bǝ nek anuŋkub ŋgɔŋ men. Bɔbɔk mine, izhin bǝ yi abɛ zi atu zhɔk ne akpamin, te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">&lt;&lt;Arik akyak abɛ lɛk atu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">Te nek abɛ zhɔk atu ta zhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Fena, izhin bǝ yi abɛ zi atu zhɔk te duŋ Arik wa ai ka lɛk zhin ne mkpaŋ maa. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Lǝk zhin ayi tɔ Arik ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah min te Arik wa ai yi ŋub zhin ai na nek zhin iki yiŋ ndi izhin wɔ bǝ.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Izhin bǝ vuŋ kpa tena sɔŋ zhin atsitsir. Tǝ ine kyak zhin ayi waŋa shetan aŋur aka ndi zaki kɛ wɔb neshir ne vuŋ gbuŋa te ta. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Izhin bǝ kyagu, te tsǝ kli zhin mgbamgbaŋ ne tanyɛme, tena zhi te amunzumin ne gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk azǝn yik iyah ir yiŋ ndi ta yige ma.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Fena Arik ne nek aneshir ita zhɔk, waŋ ndi ne zhɔ zhin ne ŋgɔŋ kɛ yaŋ klɛ ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, ndi izhin te yik ivǝya iyi yaŋ baŋ mkpaŋ, Iwa ne tu maa atei gli zhin aŋyaga te duŋ zhin bǝ yi ne mgbamgbaŋ, te klik tena vuŋ kpa. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ayi Arik wa Ŋgɔŋ yi maa kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu. Bǝ yeme.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Sila ne zɔk me cɛr ivǝ ilɛ kǝŋe, iwaŋ ndi myigu ayi zumɔr ne bla zub, Mne nak cɛr zhin watsɔb, Mnǝk zhin lɛ te kpamin bǝ ŋur klik te izhin bǝ nazhi te itanyɛme iyi Arik. Klɛ zhin mgbamgbaŋ amɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Aner abɛ zǝ Arik abaŋ ndi ayi ne ntun yi Babila, abaŋ ndi ne hria ba ben abɛ zhin, ashar te bɛ tek zhine, izu muŋ Markus maayi atǝk zhin. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Tǝk zhin akpa min ne ku asa bǝn tanyɛme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Isik susun iye Arik bǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk ne miŋ kɛ Kristi.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>